            "review_title": "Review at Bun Rieu Cua",
            "review_text": "Travelove58\n15349 contributions\n0\nGood food, delicious....eat like the locals\nSep 2022 • Family\nIt's always nice to eat Authentic good Local food the Locals way, at Locals eateries. And prices are great \"Locals\" too. The noodles came with many add ons - taste great, delicious. Very nice indeed. As regards to hygiene concerns, frankly it's unrealistic to expect 100% hygiene compliances from all food handlers - anywhere in the world. Even in posh restaurants or cafes, food poisoining occurs. Of course in locals eateries like this, one expects lower hygiene levels. Enjoy good local food while travelling, no point worry too much.\nRead more\nWritten September 11, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
