            "review_text": "kdk90814\nLong Beach, California34 contributions\n0\nHanoi Street Food Highlight\nDec 2018 • Couples\nGo early to this modest little storefront for some of the best breakfast noodles in town. The crab and tomato based broth is delicious. Just add some of the greens from a heaping plate they provide and a few chilies. About $1.50 per bowl. Local folk line up until they sell out.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 14, 2018",
